  "description_short": "Reliable all-day breakfast and generous portions in a family-friendly mall setting with consistent quality.",
  "description_long": "Located in Garden Route Mall, this Mugg & Bean delivers the chain's signature generous portions and all-day breakfast menu that South Africans know and love. The relaxed café atmosphere makes it a convenient pit stop for shoppers and families exploring George.\n\nTheir famous breakfast menu runs all day, from stacked pancakes to hearty omelettes and the beloved Mug & Bean breakfast. The coffee is consistently good, and portions are reliably large – perfect for sharing or for those with serious appetites. The burgers, salads, and sandwiches hit the spot for lunch or dinner.\n\nIt's a practical choice when you need good food without fuss, whether you're meeting friends over coffee, feeding hungry kids after shopping, or grabbing a quick meal on the N2. Service is friendly, and the mall location means easy parking and access.",
